{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2021-06-21 04:00:00', 'title': 'NORTHERN TRUST APPOINTED BY US$45BN MANAGER FUNDSMITH TO PROVIDE ASSET SERVICING SOLUTIONS TO ITS LUXEMBOURG-DOMICILED FUNDS', 'text': "LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORTHERN TRUST (NASDAQ: NTRS) TODAY ANNOUNCES IT HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO PROVIDE FUND ACCOUNTING, TRANSFER AGENCY AND GLOBAL CUSTODY SERVICES TO FUNDSMITH'S LUXEMBOURG-DOMICILED UMBRELLA, FUNDSMITH SICAV. HEADQUARTERED IN LONDON, UNITED KINGDOM (UK) WITH OFFICES IN MAURITIUS AND CONNECTICUT, USA, FUNDSMITH HAS MORE THAN £33 BILLION (APPROXIMATELY US$45BN) OF ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT (AS AT 31 DECEMBER 2020) ON BEHALF OF GLOBAL INSTITUTIONS AND INVESTORS. FUNDSMITH SICAV WA"}